- Solid hands-on experience with ELT.
- Solid hands-on experience with Kubernetes.
- Solid hands-on experience with Apache Flink.
- Solid hands-on experience with MySQL.
- Solid hands-on experience with Avro.
- Solid hands-on experience with CI/CD.

