- Familiarity with PostgreSQL.
- Familiarity with Streaming de Dados.
- Familiarity with Amazon Redshift.
- Familiarity with Data Governance.
- Familiarity with Tableau.

Benefits
- Fully remote, flexible hours, home office stipend, learning budget and paid time off.',
