SELECT (SELECT id FROM public.job_sources WHERE key = 'jobicy'),
  'seed-083',
  (SELECT id FROM public.companies WHERE slug = 'supabase'),
  'Supabase', 'Fullstack Engineer Staff', 'fullstack engineer staff',
  (SELECT id FROM public.career_tracks WHERE key = 'fullstack'),
  (SELECT rv.id FROM public.track_role_variants rv JOIN public.career_tracks ct ON ct.id = rv.track_id WHERE ct.key = 'fullstack' AND rv.key = 'fullstack_engineer'),
  'staff',
  'Remote',
  NULL, NULL, NULL,
  true, 'latam', 'remoto_global', 'en', 'full-time',
  'About the role
Supabase is hiring a Staff Fullstack Engineer to join a distributed, remote-first engineering team. You will help us scale our product across the stack.

What you will do
- Design, build and operate reliable systems in production.
- Partner with product and design to ship user-facing value continuously.
- Improve testing, observability and developer experience.
- Mentor peers and take part in technical decisions.

Requirements
- Solid hands-on experience with Python.
- Solid hands-on experience with Vitest.
- Solid hands-on experience with Jest.
- Solid hands-on experience with Express.js.
- Solid hands-on experience with Spring Boot.
- Solid hands-on experience with Playwright.

Nice to have
- Familiarity with Scrum.
- Familiarity with Autenticação.
- Familiarity with CSS.
- Familiarity with Redis.
- Familiarity with Prisma.
- Familiarity with Java.

Benefits
- Fully remote, flexible hours, home office stipend, learning budget and paid time off.',
  154400, 230100, 'USD', 'year', false,
  'https://jobs.example.com/supabase/seed-083',
  now() - interval '13 days', now() + interval '31 days',
  md5('supabase|Fullstack Engineer Staff|remoto_global'), true
ON CONFLICT (source_id, external_id) DO NOTHING;
