  'About the role
GitLab is hiring a Senior Analytics Engineer to join a distributed, remote-first engineering team. You will help us scale our data platform and analytics pipelines.

What you will do
- Design, build and operate reliable systems in production.
- Partner with product and design to ship user-facing value continuously.
- Improve testing, observability and developer experience.
- Mentor peers and take part in technical decisions.

Requirements
- Solid hands-on experience with BigQuery.
- Solid hands-on experience with Docker.
- Solid hands-on experience with Fivetran.
- Solid hands-on experience with Documentação.
- Solid hands-on experience with Scala.
- Solid hands-on experience with Looker.

Nice to have
- Familiarity with PostgreSQL.
- Familiarity with Data Quality.
- Familiarity with Databricks.
- Familiarity with Data Mesh.

Benefits
- Fully remote, flexible hours, home office stipend, learning budget and paid time off.',
  97100, 116900, 'USD', 'year', false,
  'https://jobs.example.com/gitlab/seed-103',
  now() - interval '11 days', now() + interval '26 days',
  md5('gitlab|Analytics Engineer Senior|remoto_global'), true
