Doist is hiring a Junior Data Engineer to join a distributed, remote-first engineering team. You will help us scale our data platform and analytics pipelines.

What you will do
- Design, build and operate reliable systems in production.
- Partner with product and design to ship user-facing value continuously.
- Improve testing, observability and developer experience.
- Mentor peers and take part in technical decisions.

Requirements
- Solid hands-on experience with Python.
- Solid hands-on experience with MongoDB.
- Solid hands-on experience with PostgreSQL.
- Solid hands-on experience with Data Lake.
- Solid hands-on experience with Snowflake.
- Solid hands-on experience with Comunicação.

