- Familiarity with Otimização de Consultas.
- Familiarity with Microsoft Azure.
- Familiarity with Data Quality.
- Familiarity with Kafka.
- Familiarity with Orquestração.
- Familiarity with Airbyte.

Benefits
- Fully remote, flexible hours, home office stipend, learning budget and paid time off.',
